itary hounds that chase their quarry to the bitter end.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.7,"stats":{"hp":4600,"atk":360,"def":0,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.5}},"enraged_possessed_leader":{"slug":"enraged_possessed_leader","name":"Enraged Possessed Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Enraged Possessed Leader.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Possessed","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An enemy combatant who has completely given in to primal madness as their lifeforce is consumed. The infection has penetrated their bone marrow, and their death-defying aggression breaks the bounds of reason. The appearance of such an aberration on the battlefield is almost beyond imagination.","abilities":["Will gradually lose HP over time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":1750,"def":230,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.3}},"winterwisp_blood_magister":{"slug":"winterwisp_blood_magister","name":"Winterwisp Blood Magister","icon":"/enemies-icons/Winterwisp Blood Magister.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A mixed-blood well-versed in Winterwisp's ancient Blood Arts, much more terrifying than modern Casters. Their ancient sacrificial rituals are capable of instantly dealing area Arts damage, as well as severing Arts ley lines to seize control of L-44 'Gramophones.'","abilities":["Will gradually lose HP over time","Upon death, deals a large amount of Arts damage to all surrounding units and immediately seizes control of any 'Gramophones'"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.5,"stats":{"hp":75000,"atk":650,"def":300,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.3}},"arc_frontliner_leader":{"slug":"arc_frontliner_leader","name":"Arc Frontliner Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Arc Frontliner Leader.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Deadly soldiers from an experimental unit outfitted with highly lethal cutting-edge equipment. A formidable foe even when their gear's weaknesses have been revealed.","abilities":["Loses HP proportional to distance moved when shifted"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":52000,"atk":1250,"def":1250,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"greater_armored_burdenbeast":{"slug":"greater_armored_burdenbeast","name":"Greater Armored Burdenbeast","icon":"/enemies-icons/Greater Armored Burdenbeast.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Slow, docile, and even larger, these burdenbeasts obediently undergo rigorous training to perform tasks that go against their nature.","abilities":["Will be tripped by a Stabilizer Chain, stunning itself and dealing Physical damage to nearby enemies."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":180000,"atk":2800,"def":50,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"document":{"slug":"document","name":"Document","icon":"/enemies-icons/Document.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Pith's student. Rational and good at math, with outstanding Originium Arts Assimilation. Chose to take to the battlefield as a defender operator to maintain an active mind.","abilities":["Takes greatly reduced Arts and Physical damage when force field is active; force field breaks when a large amount of damage is taken in a single instance"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":60000,"atk":1400,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"rosmontiss_drone":{"slug":"rosmontiss_drone","name":"Rosmontis's Drone","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rosmontis's Drone.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A cutting-edge drone designed by Rhodes Island's Engineering Department specifically for this round of Vector Breakout training training.\nRosmontis loves its color.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Can only be attacked while inside a Matrix.","Attacks deal AoE damage.","After two attacks, the next attack stuns all targets.","When defeated, leaves behind Supplies that will activate when Rosmontis, Simulated Sentry triggers [Cognitive Collapse]. Upon activation, allied units in a wide area will take reduced Physical and Arts damage."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":700,"def":550,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"rosmontis_simulated_sentry":{"slug":"rosmontis_simulated_sentry","name":"Rosmontis, Simulated Sentry","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rosmontis, Simulated Sentry.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"A Breakthrough Trainer simulating Rosmontis at the peak of her combat prowess.\nAs she gazes at the 'walking arsenal' brought to life from data, her memories are finally liberated. Braver and more determined, she now yearns to fight alongside her companions.","abilities":["[Mind Matrix] Takes less Physical and Arts damage. Loses this effect when the V.T.E. on the field is destroyed and cannot attack until the V.T.E. is re-obtained.","First Form","[Fling] Hurls a <V.T.E.> at an allied unit regardless of distance, dealing 3 instances of Physical damage to the target when it lands (The second and third instances are aftershocks, dealing half damage). Stunned targets are instantly defeated.","[Retrieve] Clears all Matrices on the field and retrieves all Tactical Equipment.","[Impulse Inhibition] Initiates revival when HP reaches 0, periodically dealing Arts damage over a wide area around her every few seconds during the process.","Second Form","[Amplified Fling] Hurls a second <V.T.E.> a few seconds after the first. Stunned targets are instantly defeated.","[Memory Loss] Loses a certain amount of HP with every attack and deals Arts damage over a wide area around her.","[Cognitive Collapse] Once HP drops below 50%, flies into the air and switches to ranged attacks. Increases ATK, no longer uses [Fling], and gains the following abilities:","Attacks stun the target for an extended period. [Mind Matrix] effect no longer expires and reduces damage taken even further. [Memory Loss] damage dealt and HP loss are both increased. When attacked, deals a certain amount of True damage to surrounding allies."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":2000,"def":1000,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"crossroads_prototype":{"slug":"crossroads_prototype","name":"'Crossroads' Prototype","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Crossroads' Prototype.webp","rank":"Elite"}},"dropIcons":{},"previewFile":"vec-c_act1break_h03.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[{"col":7,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_001_crate","kind":"device","name":"Roadblock","row":4},{"col":8,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_001_crate","kind":"device","name":"Roadblock","row":4}],"playbackPaths":{"0":{"points":[[6,4],[6,3],[5,3],[4,3]],"distances":[0,1,2,3],"length":3,"breaks":[],"flying":false,"holds":[{"at":0,"seconds":180,"point":[6,4],"tunnel":false}],"nodes":[[6,4],[6,3],[4,3]]},"1":{"points":[[6,2],[6,3],[5,3],[4,3]],"distances":[0,1,2,3],"length":3,"breaks":[],"flying":false,"